{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623100/extras/56ce390a4fc48a5f25a867cd570a9cff.poster.avif?t=1759238387\" width=600 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623100/extras/56ce390a4fc48a5f25a867cd570a9cff.webm?t=1759238387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623100/extras/56ce390a4fc48a5f25a867cd570a9cff.mp4?t=1759238387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You just dissociated from reality...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, the imaginary world you've landed in is as disturbed as your mental state. Gather your courage and confront your darkest thoughts in this <strong>8-bit psychological horror RPG.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623100/extras/dad22375f6b59884053b1d08bf545d1c.poster.avif?t=1759238387\" width=616 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623100/extras/dad22375f6b59884053b1d08bf545d1c.webm?t=1759238387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>True retro compatibility</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innerwhy was built to run on the <strong>Game Boy Color.</strong> Every technical limitation has been embraced: <strong>pixel art, chiptune soundtrack, limited storage\u2026</strong> it\u2019s all part of the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623100/extras/cca403683d125ef48188e94044ca2e17.avif?t=1759238387\" width=616 height=252 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everyone is feeling bad...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this retro setting, you play as Manda, a young woman trapped in a crumbling imaginary world. <strong>Here, everyone is losing their mind:</strong> mushrooms fall into despair, pumpkins get angry, and goblins are fed up with life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623100/extras/de4cdec71bb62ecc6ca2d66b3cd02bed.poster.avif?t=1759238387\" width=600 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623100/extras/de4cdec71bb62ecc6ca2d66b3cd02bed.webm?t=1759238387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623100/extras/de4cdec71bb62ecc6ca2d66b3cd02bed.mp4?t=1759238387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic turn-based battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save these troubled souls by battling them in <strong>turn-based combat</strong> powered by your <strong>emotions.</strong> Stay alert and dodge their negative vibes in real-time during <strong>Bullet Hell-style minigames.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623100/extras/d7e85d54757c552c314001bcd3515272.avif?t=1759238387\" width=616 height=496 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meta-progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will die. Probably more than once. But don\u2019t worry, a <strong>meta-progression</strong> system will make you stronger with each attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623100/extras/c2cccc5810bdc900111ff45030cccb24.poster.avif?t=1759238387\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623100/extras/c2cccc5810bdc900111ff45030cccb24.webm?t=1759238387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Randomly generated worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, randomly generated worlds ensure each playthrough offers a fresh adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Add Innerwhy to your wishlist so you don\u2019t miss the release!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3623100?t=1759238387","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3623100?t=1759238387","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623100/c1236b978476061924d77d4ccb7e13c9f326093d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759238387","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623100/c1236b978476061924d77d4ccb7e13c9f326093d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759238387","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game addresses sensitive themes, including grief, suicide and depression."},"demos":[{"appid":4022020,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623100/extras/56ce390a4fc48a5f25a867cd570a9cff