s Manda, a young woman trapped in a crumbling imaginary world. <strong>Here, everyone is losing their mind:</strong> mushrooms fall into despair, pumpkins get angry, and goblins are fed up with life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623100/extras/de4cdec71bb62ecc6ca2d66b3cd02bed.poster.avif?t=1759238387\" width=600 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623100/extras/de4cdec71bb62ecc6ca2d66b3cd02bed.webm?t=1759238387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623100/extras/de4cdec71bb62ecc6ca2d66b3cd02bed.mp4?t=1759238387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic turn-based battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save these troubled souls by battling them in <strong>turn-based combat</strong> powered by your <strong>emotions.</strong> Stay alert and dodge their negative vibes in real-time during <strong>Bullet Hell-style minigames.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623100/extras/d7e85d54757c552c314001bcd3515272.avif?t=1759238387\" width=616 height=496 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meta-progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will die. Probably more than once. But don\u2019t worry, a <strong>meta-progression</strong> system will make you stronger with each attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623100/extras/c2cccc58